1
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:03,843
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:04,677 --> 00:00:06,429
Earth...

3
00:00:06,638 --> 00:00:08,181
Fire...

4
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:10,266
Air.

5
00:00:11,059 --> 00:00:14,562
Long ago, the four nations lived
together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,063 --> 00:00:19,484
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:23,154
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:23,238 --> 00:00:27,367
But when the world needed him most,
he vanished.

9
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,662
100 years passed and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar.

10
00:00:30,745 --> 00:00:32,747
An airbender named Aang.

11
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:35,208
And although his airbending
skills are great,

12
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,669
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

13
00:00:37,752 --> 00:00:38,795
AANG: Oof!

14
00:00:38,878 --> 00:00:42,340
But I believe Aang can save the world.

15
00:00:42,882 --> 00:00:44,634
( ♪ )

16
00:00:48,054 --> 00:00:50,390
( MAN READING )

17
00:00:50,723 --> 00:00:52,475
AANG: So what's the new plan?

18
00:00:52,559 --> 00:00:55,061
SOKKA: The new plan is the old plan.

19
00:00:55,144 --> 00:00:56,896
You just need to master all four elements

20
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,274
and confront the Fire Lord
before the comet comes.

21
00:00:59,357 --> 00:01:01,693
Where am I supposed to get
a firebending teacher?

22
00:01:01,985 --> 00:01:03,152
Hello.

23
00:01:03,236 --> 00:01:04,571
Zuko here.

24
00:01:04,654 --> 00:01:08,575
I think it's time I joined your group
and taught the Avatar firebending.

25
00:01:08,992 --> 00:01:13,037
And I know my destiny is to help you
restore balance to the world.

26
00:01:13,538 --> 00:01:16,499
I think you are supposed to be
my firebending teacher.

27
00:01:18,001 --> 00:01:22,755
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

28
00:01:24,757 --> 00:01:28,386
ZUKO: I know you're nervous,
but remember, firebending

29
00:01:28,469 --> 00:01:31,097
in and of itself is not something to fear.

30
00:01:31,431 --> 00:01:32,974
( SIGHING )

31
00:01:33,057 --> 00:01:34,058
Okay.

32
00:01:34,142 --> 00:01:35,351
Not something to fear.

33
00:01:35,435 --> 00:01:37,270
But if you don't respect it

34
00:01:37,353 --> 00:01:40,106
it'll chew you up and spit you out
like an angry komodo rhino.

35
00:01:40,189 --> 00:01:41,524
( GASPING )

36
00:01:41,608 --> 00:01:43,067
Now, show me what you've got.

37
00:01:43,151 --> 00:01:45,361
Any amount of fire you can make.

38
00:01:45,445 --> 00:01:47,655
( BREATHING HEAVILY )

39
00:01:52,327 --> 00:01:54,537
Maybe I need a little more instruction.

40
00:01:54,621 --> 00:01:56,748
Perhaps a demonstration?

41
00:01:56,831 --> 00:01:58,374
ZUKO: Good idea

42
00:01:58,458 --> 00:02:00,126
You might want to take
a couple steps back.

43
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:02,003
( INHALES )

44
00:02:03,046 --> 00:02:04,839
( GRUNTING )

45
00:02:06,924 --> 00:02:08,343
What was that?

46
00:02:08,426 --> 00:02:10,261
That was the worst
firebending I've ever seen.

47
00:02:11,095 --> 00:02:13,139
I thought it was nice.

48
00:02:13,556 --> 00:02:16,601
( GRUNTING )

49
00:02:16,684 --> 00:02:18,186
( GROANING )

50
00:02:18,269 --> 00:02:20,063
Why is this happening?

51
00:02:20,146 --> 00:02:22,231
Maybe it's the altitude.

52
00:02:22,398 --> 00:02:24,692
Yeah, could be.

53
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:31,115
( GRUNTING )

54
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,202
( YAWNING )

55
00:02:34,285 --> 00:02:37,121
Just breathe, and...

56
00:02:37,955 --> 00:02:40,083
That one kind of felt hot.

57
00:02:40,208 --> 00:02:41,626
Don't patronize me.

58
00:02:41,709 --> 00:02:42,960
You know what it's supposed to look like.

59
00:02:43,044 --> 00:02:44,462
Sorry, Sifu hotman.

60
00:02:44,545 --> 00:02:46,297
And stop calling me that.

61
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:51,010
SOKKA: Hey, jerks.

62
00:02:51,094 --> 00:02:54,389
Mind if I watch you two jerks
do your jerk bending?

63
00:02:54,972 --> 00:02:56,683
Get out of here.

64
00:02:56,766 --> 00:02:58,226
Okay, take it easy.

65
00:02:58,309 --> 00:02:59,477
I was just kidding around.

66
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,853
( CHUCKLING )

67
00:03:00,937 --> 00:03:02,313
Jerk bending.

68
00:03:02,397 --> 00:03:03,773
Still got it.

69
00:03:03,856 --> 00:03:04,941
( GROANING )

70
00:03:15,368 --> 00:03:16,786
ZUKO: Listen, everybody.

71
00:03:16,869 --> 00:03:18,913
I've got some pretty bad news.

72
00:03:18,996 --> 00:03:20,498
I've lost my stuff.

73
00:03:20,623 --> 00:03:21,833
Don't look at me.

74
00:03:21,916 --> 00:03:23,710
I didn't touch your stuff.

75
00:03:24,293 --> 00:03:26,129
I'm talking about my firebending.

76
00:03:26,629 --> 00:03:28,047
It's gone.

77
00:03:28,131 --> 00:03:30,758
( KATARA LAUGHING )

78
00:03:31,384 --> 00:03:32,593
I'm sorry.

79
00:03:32,677 --> 00:03:34,178
I'm just laughing at the irony.

80
00:03:34,262 --> 00:03:36,013
You know, how it would've been nice for us

81
00:03:36,097 --> 00:03:38,182
if you'd lost your firebending
a long time ago?

82
00:03:38,307 --> 00:03:39,767
Well, it's not lost.

83
00:03:39,851 --> 00:03:42,395
It's just weaker for some reason.

84
00:03:42,478 --> 00:03:44,689
Maybe you're just not as good
as you think you are.

85
00:03:45,606 --> 00:03:47,024
Ouch.

86
00:03:49,193 --> 00:03:51,446
I bet it's because I changed sides.

87
00:03:51,612 --> 00:03:53,114
That's ridiculous.

88
00:03:53,322 --> 00:03:54,574
I don't know.

89
00:03:54,824 --> 00:03:56,534
Maybe it isn't.

90
00:03:56,617 --> 00:03:58,661
Maybe your firebending comes from rage

91
00:03:58,745 --> 00:04:02,081
and you just don't have enough anger
to fuel it the way you used to.

92
00:04:02,165 --> 00:04:05,626
So all we need to do is make Zuko angry.

93
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:07,003
Easy enough.

94
00:04:07,086 --> 00:04:09,297
( LAUGHING )

95
00:04:10,339 --> 00:04:11,632
Okay, cut it out!

96
00:04:11,716 --> 00:04:12,759
Look.

97
00:04:12,842 --> 00:04:16,471
Even if you're right, I don't want to rely
on hate and anger anymore.

98
00:04:16,763 --> 00:04:18,264
There has to be another way.

99
00:04:18,347 --> 00:04:21,809
You're gonna need to learn to draw
your firebending from a different source.

100
00:04:21,893 --> 00:04:24,437
I recommend the original source.

101
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:26,272
How's he supposed to do that?

102
00:04:26,355 --> 00:04:27,774
By jumping into a volcano?

103
00:04:27,857 --> 00:04:29,358
No.

104
00:04:29,442 --> 00:04:33,321
Zuko needs to go back to whatever
the source of firebending is.

105
00:04:33,404 --> 00:04:35,782
So is it jumping into a volcano?

106
00:04:35,865 --> 00:04:37,200
I don't know.

107
00:04:37,283 --> 00:04:39,994
For earthbending, the original benders
were badgermoles.

108
00:04:40,077 --> 00:04:44,290
One day, when I was little,
I ran away and hid in a cave.

109
00:04:44,373 --> 00:04:45,792
( CRYING )

110
00:04:45,875 --> 00:04:48,044
( CRASHING )

111
00:04:48,294 --> 00:04:49,754
That's where I met them.

112
00:04:49,837 --> 00:04:51,422
( GROWLING )

113
00:04:53,883 --> 00:04:57,678
( LAUGHING )

114
00:05:00,223 --> 00:05:04,227
They were blind, just like me, so we
understood each other.

115
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:08,439
I was able to learn earthbending,
not just as a martial art

116
00:05:08,523 --> 00:05:10,900
but as an extension of my senses.

117
00:05:11,192 --> 00:05:15,822
For them, the original earthbenders,
it wasn't just about fighting.

118
00:05:16,239 --> 00:05:19,534
It was their way of interacting
with the world.

119
00:05:21,118 --> 00:05:22,870
AANG: That's amazing, Toph.

120
00:05:23,162 --> 00:05:26,749
I learned from the monks, but the
original airbenders were the sky bison.

121
00:05:27,166 --> 00:05:29,836
Maybe you can give me
a lesson sometime, buddy.

122
00:05:29,919 --> 00:05:31,128
( GROWLING )

123
00:05:31,212 --> 00:05:33,172
Well, this doesn't help me.

124
00:05:33,256 --> 00:05:36,676
The original firebenders
were the dragons and they're extinct.

125
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:38,094
What do you mean?

126
00:05:38,177 --> 00:05:41,639
Roku had a dragon, and there were
plenty of dragons when I was a kid.

127
00:05:41,722 --> 00:05:43,599
Well, they aren't around anymore, okay?

128
00:05:43,683 --> 00:05:44,767
Okay, okay.

129
00:05:44,851 --> 00:05:46,269
Sorry.

130
00:05:46,352 --> 00:05:48,145
ZUKO: But maybe there's another way.

131
00:05:48,229 --> 00:05:51,774
The first people to learn from the dragons
were the ancient Sun Warriors.

132
00:05:52,358 --> 00:05:54,777
AANG: Sun warriors?

133
00:05:54,861 --> 00:05:57,113
Well, I know they weren't around
when I was a kid.

134
00:05:57,196 --> 00:06:00,074
No, they died off
thousands of years ago.

135
00:06:00,658 --> 00:06:04,412
But their civilization wasn't too far
from where we are now.

136
00:06:04,495 --> 00:06:07,039
Maybe we can learn
by poking around the ruins.

137
00:06:07,123 --> 00:06:09,000
It's like the monks used to tell me.

138
00:06:09,458 --> 00:06:12,503
Sometimes, the shadows of the past
can be felt by the present.

139
00:06:12,587 --> 00:06:14,213
SOKKA: So what?

140
00:06:14,297 --> 00:06:17,174
Maybe you'll pick up some
super old Sun Warrior energy

141
00:06:17,258 --> 00:06:19,468
just by standing where they stood
1,000 years ago?

142
00:06:19,552 --> 00:06:21,012
ZUKO: More or less.

143
00:06:21,095 --> 00:06:25,641
Either I find a new way to firebend,
or the Avatar has to find a new teacher.

144
00:06:31,814 --> 00:06:35,067
( WHOOSHING )

145
00:06:35,484 --> 00:06:37,153
We've been riding for hours.

146
00:06:37,236 --> 00:06:39,906
I don't know why, but I thought
this thing would be a lot faster.

147
00:06:40,406 --> 00:06:41,782
( GROWLING )

148
00:06:41,866 --> 00:06:43,451
Appa's right, Zuko.

149
00:06:43,534 --> 00:06:46,454
In our group, typically we start out our
missions with a more upbeat attitude.

150
00:06:46,913 --> 00:06:48,581
( GROANING ), I can't believe this.

151
00:06:48,789 --> 00:06:49,874
AANG: Don't worry.

152
00:06:49,957 --> 00:06:51,000
You'll get the hang of it.

153
00:06:58,799 --> 00:07:00,092
Whoa!

154
00:07:04,263 --> 00:07:05,848
ZUKO: Even though
these buildings are ancient

155
00:07:05,932 --> 00:07:08,267
there's something eerily
familiar about them.

156
00:07:08,643 --> 00:07:11,854
I can tell the fire sages' temples are
somehow descended from these.

157
00:07:12,063 --> 00:07:14,815
AANG: Okay, we've learned something
about architecture.

158
00:07:15,149 --> 00:07:17,693
Hopefully, we'll learn something about
firebending too.

159
00:07:17,818 --> 00:07:19,278
The past can be a great teacher.

160
00:07:19,362 --> 00:07:20,738
( SCREAMING )

161
00:07:23,032 --> 00:07:24,367
( AANG GRUNTING )

162
00:07:24,492 --> 00:07:26,202
( WHIMPERING )

163
00:07:26,285 --> 00:07:29,497
Zuko, I think the past
is trying to kill me.

164
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:30,915
I can't believe it.

165
00:07:30,998 --> 00:07:33,834
This booby trap must be centuries old,
and it still works.

166
00:07:34,293 --> 00:07:35,878
There's probably a lot more.

167
00:07:35,962 --> 00:07:37,880
Maybe this means we shouldn't be here.

168
00:07:42,635 --> 00:07:44,720
Where's that upbeat attitude
you were talking about?

169
00:07:45,513 --> 00:07:49,684
Besides, people don't make traps unless
they've got something worth protecting.

170
00:07:52,269 --> 00:07:53,312
Look.

171
00:07:53,396 --> 00:07:54,814
This seems promising.

172
00:07:54,897 --> 00:07:58,901
Though I'm not sure this tells us
about the original source of firebending.

173
00:07:59,694 --> 00:08:01,278
They look pretty angry to me.

174
00:08:01,362 --> 00:08:03,864
AANG: I thought the dragons were
friends with the Sun Warriors.

175
00:08:03,948 --> 00:08:05,825
ZUKO: Well, they had
a funny way of showing it.

176
00:08:10,162 --> 00:08:13,791
Zuko, something happened
to the dragons in the last 100 years.

177
00:08:14,542 --> 00:08:15,918
Something you're not telling me.

178
00:08:16,252 --> 00:08:18,838
My great-grandfather Sozin happened.

179
00:08:19,714 --> 00:08:22,466
He started the tradition
of hunting dragons for glory.

180
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:24,260
They were the ultimate firebenders.

181
00:08:24,385 --> 00:08:28,055
And if you could conquer one, your
firebending talents would become legendary

182
00:08:28,139 --> 00:08:30,516
and you'd earn the honorary title, dragon.

183
00:08:31,475 --> 00:08:37,106
The last great dragon was conquered
long before I was born, by my uncle.

184
00:08:37,982 --> 00:08:42,528
But I thought your uncle was,
I don't know, good?

185
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:44,697
He had a complicated past.

186
00:08:45,573 --> 00:08:47,158
Family tradition, I guess.

187
00:08:48,784 --> 00:08:49,869
Let's just move on.

188
00:08:58,919 --> 00:09:01,213
( GRUNTING )

189
00:09:01,297 --> 00:09:02,381
It's locked up.

190
00:09:04,967 --> 00:09:06,177
Wait.

191
00:09:07,136 --> 00:09:09,805
It's a celestial calendar.

192
00:09:09,889 --> 00:09:13,184
Just like the fire sages
have in their temples.

193
00:09:13,267 --> 00:09:15,061
I bet that sun stone opens the door

194
00:09:15,144 --> 00:09:18,731
but only when sunlight hits it
at just the right angle on the solstice.

195
00:09:18,814 --> 00:09:20,149
Monkey feathers.

196
00:09:20,483 --> 00:09:21,817
The solstice again.

197
00:09:21,901 --> 00:09:23,444
We can't wait here that long.

198
00:09:23,611 --> 00:09:25,154
No, we can't.

199
00:09:25,237 --> 00:09:27,114
But we might be able to speed time up.

200
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:29,992
Let's see if we can outsmart
the sun stone.

201
00:09:34,663 --> 00:09:36,040
Nothing's happening.

202
00:09:36,123 --> 00:09:37,291
Come on.

203
00:09:38,876 --> 00:09:40,669
( RUMBLING )

204
00:09:42,421 --> 00:09:45,549
You know, Zuko, I don't care what everyone
else says about you.

205
00:09:45,841 --> 00:09:47,009
You're pretty smart.

206
00:09:52,973 --> 00:09:53,974
( GASPING )

207
00:09:54,058 --> 00:09:55,142
Relax.

208
00:09:55,226 --> 00:09:56,685
They're just statues.

209
00:10:04,068 --> 00:10:07,238
It says this is something
called the Dancing Dragon.

210
00:10:18,791 --> 00:10:20,376
Zuko, get over here.

211
00:10:20,459 --> 00:10:21,710
I want you to dance with me.

212
00:10:21,794 --> 00:10:23,754
- What?
- Just do it.

213
00:10:25,005 --> 00:10:26,257
( ZUKO GROANING )

214
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:28,092
Let's follow the steps of the statues.

215
00:10:32,596 --> 00:10:33,931
Don't you see?

216
00:10:34,014 --> 00:10:35,349
These aren't dance moves.

217
00:10:35,432 --> 00:10:37,184
These statues are giving us a lesson.

218
00:10:37,518 --> 00:10:41,564
I think this is some kind
of Sun Warrior firebending form.

219
00:10:41,647 --> 00:10:43,941
This better teach us some
really good firebending.

220
00:10:51,991 --> 00:10:53,534
Hooray!

221
00:10:53,617 --> 00:10:54,785
Wait.

222
00:10:54,869 --> 00:10:57,121
What exactly is that?

223
00:10:57,204 --> 00:10:58,956
It's some kind of mystical gemstone.

224
00:10:59,039 --> 00:11:00,374
Well, don't touch it.

225
00:11:00,457 --> 00:11:01,584
Why not?

226
00:11:01,667 --> 00:11:03,794
Remember what happened out there
with those spikes?

227
00:11:03,878 --> 00:11:08,048
I'm just very suspicious of giant,
glowing gems sitting on pedestals.

228
00:11:09,216 --> 00:11:12,136
It feels almost alive.

229
00:11:13,220 --> 00:11:15,556
( SCREAMING )

230
00:11:16,098 --> 00:11:18,058
Oh, no, it's another trap.

231
00:11:20,603 --> 00:11:21,687
( GROANING )

232
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:23,063
I can't pull free.

233
00:11:23,147 --> 00:11:24,815
It's like some kind of glue.

234
00:11:30,487 --> 00:11:32,364
( GRUNTING )

235
00:11:32,573 --> 00:11:33,699
( GRUNTING )

236
00:11:38,329 --> 00:11:39,872
( GROANING )

237
00:11:42,833 --> 00:11:44,835
I can't move.

238
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:46,212
Zuko, do something.

239
00:11:46,295 --> 00:11:47,630
Me?

240
00:11:47,713 --> 00:11:49,089
I can't move either.

241
00:11:51,634 --> 00:11:53,802
( GROANING )

242
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,347
It stopped.

243
00:11:56,430 --> 00:11:58,098
At least we have air.

244
00:11:58,182 --> 00:12:01,060
Maybe if we stay calm,
we can figure a way out of this.

245
00:12:07,066 --> 00:12:11,028
You had to pick up
the glowing egg, didn't you?

246
00:12:11,528 --> 00:12:13,364
At least I made
something happen.

247
00:12:13,447 --> 00:12:15,908
If it were up to you, we'd never
have made it past the courtyard.

248
00:12:15,991 --> 00:12:17,576
Help!

249
00:12:18,244 --> 00:12:20,162
Who are you yelling to?

250
00:12:20,246 --> 00:12:21,830
Nobody's lived here for centuries.

251
00:12:21,914 --> 00:12:24,708
Well, what do you think we should do?

252
00:12:25,584 --> 00:12:27,753
Think about our place in the universe?

253
00:12:29,672 --> 00:12:31,257
( SIGHING )

254
00:12:33,509 --> 00:12:34,677
Who is down there?

255
00:12:48,190 --> 00:12:52,361
For trying to take our sun stone,
you must be severely punished.

256
00:12:52,444 --> 00:12:54,697
We didn't come here
to take your sun stone.

257
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,700
We came here to find the
ancient origin of all firebending.

258
00:12:58,325 --> 00:12:59,910
MAN: yeah, right.

259
00:12:59,994 --> 00:13:03,414
They are obviously thieves,
here to steal Sun Warrior treasures.

260
00:13:03,497 --> 00:13:04,873
AANG: Please.

261
00:13:04,957 --> 00:13:08,794
I don't normally play this card,
but I'm the Avatar.

262
00:13:13,507 --> 00:13:15,050
Just hear us out.

263
00:13:15,134 --> 00:13:19,388
My name is Zuko,
Crown Prince of the Fire Nation.

264
00:13:19,471 --> 00:13:21,056
Or at least, I used to be.

265
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:23,976
I know my people have distorted
the ways of firebending,

266
00:13:24,059 --> 00:13:26,103
to be fueled
by anger and rage.

267
00:13:26,186 --> 00:13:29,940
But now I want to learn the true way,
the original way.

268
00:13:30,482 --> 00:13:31,817
When we came here, I never imagined

269
00:13:31,900 --> 00:13:35,029
the Sun Warrior civilization
was secretly alive.

270
00:13:35,112 --> 00:13:37,614
I am truly humbled to be in your presence.

271
00:13:38,324 --> 00:13:40,242
Please, teach us.

272
00:13:41,410 --> 00:13:44,246
If you wish to learn the ways of the sun

273
00:13:44,330 --> 00:13:48,042
you must learn them from
the masters Ran and Shao.

274
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:50,044
Ran and Shao?

275
00:13:50,127 --> 00:13:51,337
There are two of them?

276
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:55,466
When you present yourselves
to them, they will examine you.

277
00:13:55,549 --> 00:14:00,012
They'll read your hearts,
your souls, and your ancestry.

278
00:14:00,095 --> 00:14:02,473
If they deem you worthy,
they'll teach you.

279
00:14:02,556 --> 00:14:07,353
If they don't, you'll be
destroyed on the spot.

280
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:19,615
CHIEF: If you're going to see the masters,

281
00:14:19,698 --> 00:14:23,369
you must bring them a piece
of the eternal flame.

282
00:14:23,952 --> 00:14:28,040
This fire is the very first one.

283
00:14:28,123 --> 00:14:30,667
It was given to man by the dragons.

284
00:14:30,751 --> 00:14:33,837
We have kept it going
for thousands of years.

285
00:14:33,921 --> 00:14:35,672
I don't believe it.

286
00:14:35,881 --> 00:14:39,093
CHIEF: You will each take
a piece of it to the masters

287
00:14:39,176 --> 00:14:43,555
to show your commitment to
the sacred art of firebending.

288
00:14:44,181 --> 00:14:46,392
Um, Mister Sun Chief, sir?

289
00:14:46,475 --> 00:14:49,144
Yeah, I'm not a firebender yet.

290
00:14:49,228 --> 00:14:51,772
Couldn't my friend here
carry my fire for me?

291
00:14:51,855 --> 00:14:52,981
No.

292
00:14:57,694 --> 00:15:03,158
This ritual illustrates
the essence of Sun Warrior philosophy.

293
00:15:03,575 --> 00:15:05,953
You must maintain a constant heat.

294
00:15:06,036 --> 00:15:09,540
The flame will go out
if you make it too small.

295
00:15:09,623 --> 00:15:12,960
Make it too big,
and you might lose control.

296
00:15:16,004 --> 00:15:17,589
I'm sorry.

297
00:15:17,673 --> 00:15:19,716
I'm just a little nervous.

298
00:15:21,385 --> 00:15:23,679
It's like a little heartbeat.

299
00:15:23,762 --> 00:15:27,933
Fire is life, not just destruction.

300
00:15:28,016 --> 00:15:30,811
You will take your flames up there.

301
00:15:30,894 --> 00:15:34,440
The cave of the masters
is beneath that rock.

302
00:15:44,032 --> 00:15:45,242
Hurry up.

303
00:15:45,325 --> 00:15:46,452
I can't.

304
00:15:46,535 --> 00:15:48,245
If I walk too fast, my flame'll go out.

305
00:15:48,328 --> 00:15:50,706
Your flame's gonna go out
because it's too small.

306
00:15:50,956 --> 00:15:52,166
You're too timid.

307
00:15:52,249 --> 00:15:53,375
Give it more juice.

308
00:15:53,459 --> 00:15:55,169
But what if I can't control it?

309
00:15:55,252 --> 00:15:56,336
You can do it.

310
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:57,421
I know you can.

311
00:15:57,504 --> 00:15:59,006
You're a talented kid.

312
00:16:12,561 --> 00:16:18,775
Facing the judgment of the firebending
masters will be very dangerous for you.

313
00:16:18,859 --> 00:16:23,822
Your ancestors are directly responsible
for the dragons' disappearance.

314
00:16:24,490 --> 00:16:28,035
The masters might not be
so happy to see you.

315
00:16:28,118 --> 00:16:30,078
I know I wouldn't be.

316
00:16:30,162 --> 00:16:32,122
But once they find out I'm the Avatar...

317
00:16:32,289 --> 00:16:34,625
Have you forgotten that you vanished

318
00:16:34,708 --> 00:16:37,753
allowing the Fire Nation
to wreak havoc on the world?

319
00:16:37,836 --> 00:16:41,381
The decline of the dragons
is your burden too.

320
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,604
We could turn back now.

321
00:16:55,687 --> 00:16:58,273
We've already learned more
about fire than we'd hoped.

322
00:16:59,525 --> 00:17:01,693
No, we're seeing through to the end.

323
00:17:01,777 --> 00:17:05,197
We're gonna meet these masters
and find out what's so great about them.

324
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:08,033
What if they judge us and attack us?

325
00:17:08,116 --> 00:17:10,118
Well, we're the fire prince
and the Avatar.

326
00:17:10,202 --> 00:17:12,955
I think we could take these guys in
a fight, whoever they are.

327
00:17:19,545 --> 00:17:20,921
Bring 'em out.

328
00:17:21,004 --> 00:17:22,756
Chanters!

329
00:17:24,299 --> 00:17:28,554
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

330
00:18:08,218 --> 00:18:13,932
MAN: Those who wish to meet the masters
Ran and Shao will now present their fire.

331
00:18:18,604 --> 00:18:20,772
CHIEF: Sound the call.

332
00:18:22,149 --> 00:18:24,484
( HORN BLOWING )

333
00:18:25,319 --> 00:18:27,029
( CRASHING )

334
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:29,906
What's happening?

335
00:18:34,453 --> 00:18:35,579
( GASPING )

336
00:18:35,662 --> 00:18:37,039
Zuko, my fire went out.

337
00:18:37,122 --> 00:18:38,248
What do you want me to do?

338
00:18:38,332 --> 00:18:39,333
Give me some of yours.

339
00:18:39,416 --> 00:18:40,709
( GRUNTING )

340
00:18:40,792 --> 00:18:42,419
- No, just make your own.
- I can't.

341
00:18:42,502 --> 00:18:43,503
( GRUNTING )

342
00:18:43,587 --> 00:18:45,464
ZUKO: Get some from one of those warriors.
Hurry.

343
00:18:45,631 --> 00:18:47,090
Stop cheating off me.

344
00:18:47,341 --> 00:18:48,634
AANG: Quit being stingy.

345
00:18:49,009 --> 00:18:51,803
( BOTH GRUNTING )

346
00:18:56,183 --> 00:18:57,476
( CRASHING )

347
00:18:58,852 --> 00:19:00,062
BOTH: Uh-oh.

348
00:19:01,813 --> 00:19:02,939
( DRAGON GROWLING )

349
00:19:15,243 --> 00:19:16,662
These are the masters.

350
00:19:16,745 --> 00:19:18,705
You still think we can take 'em?

351
00:19:18,789 --> 00:19:19,915
Shh.

352
00:19:19,998 --> 00:19:21,166
I never said that.

353
00:19:27,589 --> 00:19:29,466
Oh, here it comes.

354
00:19:29,549 --> 00:19:30,759
Any moment now.

355
00:19:30,842 --> 00:19:32,260
Dinner for the masters.

356
00:19:32,344 --> 00:19:33,345
Quiet, Ham Ghao.

357
00:19:33,428 --> 00:19:34,638
What?

358
00:19:34,721 --> 00:19:36,056
Everyone's thinking it.

359
00:19:44,398 --> 00:19:48,235
Zuko, I think we're supposed to
do the dragon dance with them.

360
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,736
What?

361
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:52,614
What about this situation makes you think
they want us to dance?

362
00:19:52,698 --> 00:19:55,492
Well, I think they want us
to do something.

363
00:19:56,159 --> 00:19:58,036
Let's just try it.

364
00:19:58,120 --> 00:19:59,162
Fine.

365
00:20:25,188 --> 00:20:26,982
Judgment time.

366
00:20:27,065 --> 00:20:29,359
( DRAGON GROWLING )

367
00:20:31,319 --> 00:20:32,529
( WHIMPERING )

368
00:20:36,199 --> 00:20:37,826
( AANG AND ZUKO SCREAMING )

369
00:20:48,962 --> 00:20:50,172
( GASPING )

370
00:20:52,132 --> 00:20:53,592
I understand.

371
00:21:14,946 --> 00:21:16,823
Their fire was beautiful.

372
00:21:16,990 --> 00:21:20,452
I saw so many colors,
colors I've never imagined.

373
00:21:20,535 --> 00:21:22,287
AANG: Like firebending harmony.

374
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:23,705
Yes.

375
00:21:24,414 --> 00:21:29,503
They judged you, and gave you visions of
the meaning of firebending.

376
00:21:30,003 --> 00:21:32,380
I can't believe there are
still living dragons

377
00:21:32,464 --> 00:21:35,550
My uncle Iroh said he faced
the last dragon and killed it.

378
00:21:35,634 --> 00:21:37,385
So your uncle lied.

379
00:21:37,469 --> 00:21:40,722
Actually, it wasn't a total lie.

380
00:21:40,806 --> 00:21:44,184
Iroh was the last outsider
to face the masters.

381
00:21:44,267 --> 00:21:49,481
They deemed him worthy
and passed the secret on to him as well.

382
00:21:50,273 --> 00:21:53,944
ZUKO: He must've lied to protect them,
so no one else would hunt them.

383
00:21:54,694 --> 00:21:58,615
All this time, I thought
firebending was destruction.

384
00:21:58,907 --> 00:22:02,702
Since I hurt Katara,
I've been too afraid and hesitant

385
00:22:02,911 --> 00:22:05,080
But now I know what it really is.

386
00:22:05,163 --> 00:22:07,457
It's energy, and life.

387
00:22:07,833 --> 00:22:08,917
Yeah.

388
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,294
It's like the sun, but inside of you.

389
00:22:11,378 --> 00:22:12,963
Do you guys realize this?

390
00:22:13,046 --> 00:22:19,094
Well, our civilization is called
the Sun Warriors, so yeah.

391
00:22:19,177 --> 00:22:21,847
That's why my firebending
was so weak before,

392
00:22:21,930 --> 00:22:25,517
because for so many years,
hunting you was my drive.

393
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:27,477
It was my purpose.

394
00:22:27,561 --> 00:22:31,189
So when I joined you,
I lost sight of my inner fire.

395
00:22:31,648 --> 00:22:34,359
But now, I have a new drive.

396
00:22:34,442 --> 00:22:38,405
I have to help you defeat my father
and restore balance to the world.

397
00:22:49,457 --> 00:22:55,046
Now that you have learned the secrets
and you know about our tribe's existence,

398
00:22:55,922 --> 00:23:00,719
we have no choice but to
imprison you here forever.

399
00:23:02,387 --> 00:23:04,556
Just kidding.

400
00:23:05,181 --> 00:23:07,893
But seriously, don't tell anyone.

401
00:23:10,020 --> 00:23:15,025
AANG: With this technique the dragons
showed us, Zuko and I will be unstoppable.

402
00:23:18,403 --> 00:23:19,863
( APPLAUSE )

403
00:23:19,946 --> 00:23:22,032
SOKKA: Yeah, that's a great
dance you two learned there.

404
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,533
It's not a dance.

405
00:23:23,617 --> 00:23:24,910
It's a firebending form.

406
00:23:25,243 --> 00:23:28,371
We'll just tap dance our way
to victory over the Fire Lord.

407
00:23:28,455 --> 00:23:31,791
It's a sacred form that happens to be
thousands of years old.

408
00:23:32,292 --> 00:23:33,460
Oh, yeah?

409
00:23:33,543 --> 00:23:35,128
What's your little form called?

410
00:23:36,129 --> 00:23:37,881
The Dancing Dragon.

411
00:23:38,423 --> 00:23:40,717
( LAUGHTER )

412
00:23:49,851 --> 00:23:52,646
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

413
00:23:58,652 --> 00:24:00,362
( ♪ )
